// DELIBERATELY BROKEN: a three-step citation loop (one → two → three → one). The wait-for
// graph is FUNCTIONAL (each parked task waits on exactly one other), so detection is a walk
// that asks "does following the blockers lead back to me?" — no cycle length is special,
// and every participant is named in the report.
pred p

theorem one: p
proof
  @conclusion |
    p
    [by cite two]
qed

theorem two: p
proof
  @conclusion |
    p
    [by cite three]
qed

theorem three: p
proof
  @conclusion |
    p
    [by cite one]
qed
